div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14170\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=14170\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker61","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=15786\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=15786\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker62","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=110778\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=110778\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker63","name":"Qidshuri Monster","legend":"Inscriptions say a relic monster of 18 m long inhabits Qidshuri Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Cineia Monster","legend":"Journeying folk say a relic monster of 11 m long inhabits Cineia Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Chisbury Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 m long."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Leigh Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 40 m long."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Newbury Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 27 m long."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Modge Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 m long."},{"id":"marker69","name":"Ansse Beast","legend":"Whispers speak of a huge Beast who inhabits Ansse hills and keeps the region at bay."},{"id":"marker70","name":"Flonia Hydra","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a terrifying Hydra who inhabits Flonia hills and attacks unsuspecting victims."},{"id":"marker71","name":"Rarebu Bearded Devil","legend":"Tales speak of a lucky Bearded Devil who inhabits Rarebu hills and prefers eating children."},{"id":"marker72","name":"Cuiwabermodu Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Artxuriruti Doctrine."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Para Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Artxuriruti Doctrine."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Ziortziku Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Artxuriruti Doctrine."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Abegulegirdu Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Artxuriruti Doctrine."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Estia Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Artxuriruti Doctrine."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Esh-Tu Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Artxuriruti Doctrine."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Shag Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Mesopotamian Religion."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Akshabur Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Mesopotamian Religion."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Arruruk Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Gilumism."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Bilgoioasar Badgers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Karmirri Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Gaukiz Jackals","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Urrun Foxes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Winvergorvie Ravens","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Shushagaz Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠮᢢᢢᠨᢠᡓᡝᠧᡠᡠᢋᠼᢏᢓᡀᡗᡜᢜᡗᢡᡎᡟᡐᢏᠵᢋᢛᡙᢓᡠᡆᠳᡠᡎᠰᡍᠦᡍᢏᢛᠪᢀᡟᢥᡎᢠᠭᡑᢐᢡᡍᢓᠪᡴᡑᡯᡲᡖᡝᢀᡐᠮᠮᠯᠰᠵᡱᡭᡡᠨᠲᠿᢐᡁᡠᠡᡀᡟᢑᡠᠱᢢᠠᡰᢓᠨᡁᠻᢋ᠑</div>"},{"id":"marker97","name":"Botbury Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠመገገረከቀወቀከቀ ፀሰከፈፈጸቀአመጰነ ጸዘሰ ረጸነደወፀነአሀ ፀጠሰሰሀፈ የፐጠፐፀፈረቀየመገአየጰጰፀረፐሰፀ ነ</div>"},{"id":"marker98","name":"Pisovercu Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳑ ⳾Ⲻ⳥ⳀⳢⲲⳆⳢⳭⲺ⳩ⳆⲸⲲⳔⳭⳬⳀⳄⳚⳲⳖⳠ⳹Ⳝ ⳔⳖ ⳃ ⳄⳘⳁⳤ ⳧⳹ⳫⳖⳲ⳹ⳜⳀⳌ⳹⳩ⳔⲲⲸ ⲺⳜⳤⳢⳌⳠⳂⲺⳃⳀⳎⳞⳤⳆⳲⳞⳠ⳹ⳜⳲⳤⳞⲼⳆⳐⲼⳢ⳧Ⲻ⳹⳥ⲺⳚⳄⳆⲶⳞⲲⲸⳲⲺ⳧ⳌⳄⳆⳞ⳪</div>"},{"id":"marker99","name":"Seskiz Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༁༣༮༾༃༪༑༈༥༸༩༔༬༼༲༲༐༑༲༥༮༵༯༸༤༊༩༪༮༫༕༿༓༦༌༴༩༡༭༤༊༽༑༸༉༈༱༬༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫</div>"},{"id":"marker100","name":"Hinekalla Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አቀኀሠነተወሰየአለሐገ ደጰተፀየጰገጰየነፐነሐጸ ፀፀወከ ገሀሰሀከነመፀጠ በበ</div>"},{"id":"marker101","name":"Auraindain Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳊⳖⳆ ⳚⳒⳁⳚⳞⳭ⳾Ⳏ ⳞⲼⳬⳄ⳹ⳆⳎⳖⲺⳚⳊⳤⳒⳤⲸⳃⳬⳢ⳩ⳭⳃⳖⲾⲺⳫⳔⳘⲴ⳧⳪ⳔⳖⳂ⳥ⳘⳘ</div>"},{"id":"marker102","name":"Targentum Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ጸሠተሠየየኀወ ረአ ነኀገተ ጰፐወጠአጠወረዐደገዐገአአገለረበየተጸሠወአተደሠኀዘዐ ጸዐጰኀሀነቀፀ አመደጰሠወ የሠ</div>"},{"id":"marker103","name":"Goleshan Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ቀአሰበ ዘጠነለወጰሰየሐጠ ፈጠወመሰተፀኀጰኀጸነሐነረፐነ ጰሀነፐፐረሀጸጸደለሀገቀፀየ ነወቀረሠ</div>"},{"id":"marker104","name":"Azkosa Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ከጰጠሰሀጸኀ ሀፐሀወጰጸደአዘቀጰ ነኀለዐበበዐፈተ ወአረከቀረለተጸመ ሐአመየ</div>"},{"id":"marker105","name":"Cigunum Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ገጸአሐደዐሰሰ ፀገዘጠ ረሠፐጰረለጸጸወተወፀደኀደአወየቀመወፈዘከወፀኀአፈፈአሠ ወደጸኀ ፈገበ</div>"},{"id":"marker106","name":"Uhantash Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༯༄༖༈༬༼༮༵༄༳༭༖༽༣༳༠༤༶༅༔༇༽༽༖༽༷༑༙༲༾༬༈༬༸༿༱༑༤༃༠༊༇༧༦༥༁༢༾༯༂༢༲༺༒༃༪༴༄༂༜༄༾༼༂༆༩༫༄༼༐༤༶༴༗༺༦༴༻༂༳༻༇༻༅༦༖༡༈༸༺༙༮༩༷༸༧༫༕༇</div>"},{"id":"marker107","name":"Gizrishna Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳜⳭⳔ ⲾⳂⲸⳘ⳥ⲺⳲⳘ⳪Ⳑ ⳥⳾ⳞⲴⳃⳃⳆⳀⳖ ⳾ⳘⳞⳐ⳹⳩ⳈⳌⲴⳞⳬⳲ Ⳅ⳧ⳒⲴⳘⳁ⳩ⲺⲾⲾ⳪Ⳝ⳪ ⳜⳊⳊⳈ</div>"},{"id":"marker108","name":"Ketos Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠓\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠩𐠮\ud802\ud802𐠛𐠼\udc1d𐠴\udc20\udc0a𐠴\udc0e\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠫\udc0e\ud802\ud802 \udc14𐠐\udc2d\ud802𐠧\udc02\udc13\ud802𐠖\udc0d\udc23\udc18\udc1f\udc3c𐠎\udc0c\ud802𐠖\udc18𐠩\udc10\ud802𐠿\udc30\ud802\ud802𐠘𐠳\udc0c\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc2b\ud802𐠮𐠦\udc2a𐠏\udc34\udc2a\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker109","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker120","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker121","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker122","name":"Dena Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker123","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker124","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker125","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker126","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker127","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker128","name":"Sumarkaria Contest","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a contest of acumen in Sumarkaria, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker129","name":"Gawranuka Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Gawranuka, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Shurdatum Brook to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Leopards migration","legend":"A huge group of leopards are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Snakes migration","legend":"A huge group of snakes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Sharks migration","legend":"A huge group of sharks are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Geese migration","legend":"A huge group of geese are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Kinzapi celebration","legen